{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CggUtzHAx1HRWagwscML7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Model.** A tetrahedral d⁷ ion has a ⁴A₂ ground state. It has the same term structure as octahedral d³, with Dq now meaning Dq(tet). The three spin-allowed bands are:\n\n- ν₁ = ⁴A₂→⁴T₂, which is ideally 10Dq.\n- ν₂ = ⁴A₂→⁴T₁(F).\n- ν₃ = ⁴A₂→⁴T₁(P).\n\nThe two ⁴T₁ states mix through a 2×2 matrix. Its diagonal entries are 6Dq for ⁴T₁(F) and 15B for ⁴T₁(P), and the off-diagonal entry is 6B. The energies are measured from the ⁴F term, and the ground state sits at −12Dq. Each band energy is therefore an eigenvalue plus 12Dq.\n\n**Fit.** I used the two upper bands, which fix both Dq and B. The ν₁ band is then a check.\n\n- Trace condition: ν₂ + ν₃ = 30Dq + 15B = 23 430, so B = 1562 − 2Dq.\n- Determinant condition: (ν₂ − 12Dq)(ν₃ − 12Dq) = 90DqB − 36B².\n- Substituting B gives 468Dq² − 646 668Dq + 2.031×10⁸ = 0, which has the physical root Dq ≈ 483 cm⁻¹.\n- Then B ≈ 1562 − 2(483) ≈ 600 cm⁻¹, which is about 62% of the free-ion value of about 970 cm⁻¹.\n\n**Check.** The fitted Dq predicts ν₁ ≈ 10Dq ≈ 4 830 cm⁻¹, against 4 070 observed. That is a gap of about 760 cm⁻¹. Setting Dq = 407 cm⁻¹ from ν₁ instead gives a B that cannot reproduce ν₂ and ν₃. For example, B = 700 gives about 5 760 and 17 340 cm⁻¹. The ν₁ band is most likely shifted by spin-orbit coupling and vibronic effects, and the simple model does not include those. The values below are therefore approximate, and I did not run a least-squares fit across all three bands.\n\n**Result:** Dq ≈ 480 cm⁻¹ (Δt ≈ 4 800 cm⁻¹) and B ≈ 600 cm⁻¹. C is not determined, because the spin-allowed bands of d⁷ do not depend on it.\n\n{\"Dq\": 483, \"B\": 600, \"C\": null, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Fit of nu2 and nu3 with the d3-equivalent tetrahedral d7 model gives Dq≈483 and B≈600, but nu1 is off by about 760 cm^-1 so the values are approximate.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7974,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7974,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7ad45749-e4c9-4d73-bd03-4c397bcf4e25","uuid":"d27908b4-b693-4f39-b0f6-93798ac43a79","timestamp":"2026-11-03T18:39:17.698Z","request_id":"req_011CggUtyt7VgpmS297guJuy"}
